{
 "id": "7b604f40-f096-41e6-9023-1fb2d52f1fd6",
 "type": "manga",
 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "The young lady whose fiancé cheated on her is doted on by the tough leader of a foreign country - She was cursed to turn into a cat, but she gets petted every day"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "婚約者に浮気された令嬢は異国の強面盟主に溺愛される～呪いで猫になりましたが、毎日モフられています～"
   },
   {
    "ja-ro": "Konyakusha ni Uwakisareta Reijou wa Ikoku no Kowamote Meishu ni Dekiaisareru - Noroi de Neko no narimashita ga, Mainichi Mofurareteimasu"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Miranda, who is not good at talking, somehow turns into a cat on the day she is engaged to the man she loves!\nHer family, unaware that Miranda has turned into a cat, kicks her out of their mansion, and\nwhen she goes to her fiance's house to ask for help, she witnesses him cheating on her, and she ends up wandering around at a loss.\nBut then she is saved by Burke, a tough-looking young man who loves animals.\nBurke has terrible luck with women and hates them, but\nhe is kind to Miranda, who he thinks is a cat, and Burke's kindness heals Miranda's wounded heart.\nThen, one day, something happens that allows her to return to her human form..."
  },
